comments":2,"created_at":"2025-08-28T03:19:01Z","updated_at":"2025-08-30T02:34:22Z","closed_at":"2025-08-29T17:06:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110044","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110044","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110044.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110044.patch","merged_at":"2025-08-29T17:06:40Z"},"body":"Closes #104297\r\n\r\nThere are four places where users can provide the name of a theme type:\r\n\r\n1. Clicking \"+\" button in the Theme bottom panel to add a new theme type.\r\n2. Clicking \"I\" button in the Theme bottom panel to rename an existing theme type.\r\n3. Clicking \"+\" button in the Manage Theme Items dialog to add a new theme type.\r\n4. Double clicking an theme type list item in the Manage Theme Items dialog to rename an existing theme type.\r\n\r\nCurrently, place 1 does no check while the others mistakenly prohibit the use of names beginning with numbers.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the validation and adds the missing check in place 1.\r\n\r\np.s. Also optimized `Theme::is_valid_type_name()` and `Theme::is_valid_item_name()`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":